{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2021-08-12 11:00:00', 'title': 'KROGER ANNOUNCES 2021 GO FRESH & LOCAL SUPPLIER ACCELERATOR COHORT', 'text': 'CINCINNATI, AUG. 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS INAUGURAL GO FRESH & LOCAL SUPPLIER ACCELERATOR COHORT – MAAZAH, NONA LIM, QUEEN CHARLOTTE\'S PIMENTO CHEESE ROYALE, SIMPLY SOUTHERN SIDES, AND SOUPERGIRL. "WE INVENTED THE GO FRESH & LOCAL SUPPLIER ACCELERATOR TO DISCOVER THE BEST, MOST INNOVATIVE, AND FRESHEST LOCAL AND REGIONAL PRODUCTS – AND OUR GROUP OF WINNERS IS JUST THAT," SAID DAN DE LA ROSA, KROGER\'S GROUP VICE PRESIDENT OF FRESH MERCHANDISING.'}